   "wikipedia": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Buckcherry_%28album%29",
   "resumo_en": "Buckcherry is the debut album by American rock band Buckcherry. It was released on April 6, 1999, by DreamWorks Records. \"Lit Up\", \"For the Movies\", \"Dead Again\", and \"Check Your Head\" were released as singles. As of September 2006, the album has sold in excess of 750,000 copies, and was certified Gold by both the RIAA and Canada, It is the band's only album as a four-piece."
